    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="190" width="385" height="215">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" fontFamily="Consolas" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>import numpy as np, pandas as pd</p>
        <p>import xarray as xr</p>
        <p>arr = np.load("ppi_sample.npy")</p>
        <p>ds = xr.Dataset({"dbz": (("az","r"), arr)},</p>
        <p>    coords={"az": np.linspace(0,360,360,False),</p>
        <p>            "r": np.linspace(0,230,400)})</p>
        <p>hi = ds["dbz"].where(ds["dbz"]&gt;=30)</p>
        <p>hi.plot(x="r", y="az", cmap="jet")</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="430" width="840" height="80">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(75,85,99,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">高频坑：</span>sel 用标签、isel 用位置；坐标要单调递增；np.nan 与 np.ma 不混用；CSV 用 utf-8-sig 写出。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">示例：</span>H:\hn\radar_202609\ 下三个 ipynb（NumPy 回波数组 / Pandas 站点降水 / Xarray 读写索引）。</p>
